CREATED:20260429T185343Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260819T131718Z
UID:6536-1789218000-1789228800@bloomspinweave.org
SUMMARY:Beginning Sock Knitting with Yvonne Jones\, Week 4
DESCRIPTION:You’ve learned to knit so now what?  Well\, let’s knit some socks!  This workshop will be for the very beginner sock knitter\, but suitable if you are a cuff-down sock knitter and would like to try toe-up.  We will talk about different types of sock\, heel\, and toe construction\, then we will CAST-ON for a Beginner TOE-UP MAGIC LOOP Sock! \nThe workshop will take place over 4 weeks; Saturdays\, August 22\, August 29\, September 5\, & September 12\, 2026. 1:00- 4:00 PM each day. \nWeek 4: We will talk about different types of bind offs and choose one that has enough stretch to get your sock onto your foot\, then knit the cuff and finish your sock. \nREGISTRATION CLOSED \n\n           Download QR
URL:https://bloomspinweave.org/event/beginning-sock-knitting-with-yvonne-jones-week-4
CATEGORIES:Bloomington Spinners and Weavers Fiber Arts Guild Calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bloomspinweave.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/0822-0905-Sock-Workshop-Yvonne-Jones-CROPPED.jpg
END:VEVENT
